# ============================================================================
# LiteLLM Proxy - NVIDIA API Key Load Balancing Configuration
# ============================================================================
# This file configures LiteLLM to load balance across multiple NVIDIA API keys.
# Get keys from: https://integrate.api.nvidia.com
#
# SETUP INSTRUCTIONS:
# 1. Replace the placeholder values below with your actual NVIDIA API keys
# 2. Add as many keys as you have (KEY_1 through KEY_N)
# 3. LiteLLM will automatically round-robin across them using least-busy routing
# 4. Start the LiteLLM proxy: cd OpenUI && docker-compose up -d
# 5. The proxy will be available at http://localhost:4000
# ============================================================================

